WEBVTT

00:19:28.333 --> 00:19:32.292
Change, we all know,
is necessary right now.

00:19:33.917 --> 00:19:35.458
And yet, it's not easy.

00:19:37.417 --> 00:19:42.583
We know that there has to be changes
in policing in this nation of ours.

00:19:43.542 --> 00:19:46.458
But I want to talk about America's choice

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:49.000
at a greater level.

00:19:49.833 --> 00:19:52.059
The prophet said to us,

00:19:52.083 --> 00:19:54.434
"We still have a choice today:

00:19:54.458 --> 00:19:56.809
nonviolent coexistence,

00:19:56.833 --> 00:19:59.083
or violent coannihilation."